            <title>[LU-19001] osp_create uses likely wrongly</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-19001</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;smatch highlights that osp_create uses likely() wrongly:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="code panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="codeContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre class="code-java"&gt;
        &lt;span class="code-comment"&gt;/* we might have lost precreated objects */&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;span class="code-keyword"&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; (unlikely(d-&amp;gt;opd_gap_count) &amp;gt; 0) {
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;where as it clearly should be if (unlikely(d-&amp;gt;opd_gap_count &amp;gt; 0))&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Introduced in &lt;a href="http://review.whamcloud.com/4030" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;http://review.whamcloud.com/4030&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
